; One variable: `internationalization/locale/test` is "ar-EG", which `set_locale` standardises to "ar_EG" (translation_server.cpp:482)
; before `_get_locale()` returns it. ProgressBar
; writes its percentage as `format_number(...)` plus the locale's percent sign (progress_bar.cpp:168-174),
; SpinBox its value (spin_box.cpp:91-93) and CodeEdit its line numbers, padded first (code_edit.cpp:1569-1572),
; while `localize_numeral_system` is on. Each control appears twice, the second with the property off.
; The root sets `layout_direction = 2` (LTR), so the right-to-left locale mirrors nothing.

